sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Platform Operator
    participant Cfg as Configurator
    participant UM as User Management
    participant EMPI as EMPI Service
    participant MTD as Master &<br/>Tenant Data
    participant FM as Feature Modules<br/>(OPD, Pharmacy, Lab…)
    participant Bus as Event Bus

    Admin->>Cfg: Create tenant<br/>(name, type, isolation level, enabled modules)

    Cfg->>Cfg: Provision iq_tenant_id<br/>Initialize tenant config record

    Cfg->>UM: Create initial admin user<br/>(admin credentials, iq_tenant_id)

    UM->>UM: Provision tenant auth config<br/>(IdP selection, SCIM endpoints,<br/>Cerbos scope identifier)

    UM-->>Cfg: Admin user created

    Cfg->>Bus: Publish tenant.provisioned event
    Note over Bus: Event payload includes:<br/>iq_tenant_id, enabled modules,<br/>data isolation level

    par Parallel initialization
        Bus->>EMPI: tenant.provisioned
        EMPI->>EMPI: Initialize tenant-scoped<br/>patient index (empty)
        EMPI-->>Bus: Ready
    and
        Bus->>MTD: tenant.provisioned
        MTD->>MTD: Make global reference datasets<br/>available to new tenant<br/>(ICD, drug catalog, SNOMED…)
        Note over MTD: No tenant overrides yet —<br/>hospital admin adds later
        MTD-->>Bus: Ready
    and
        Bus->>FM: tenant.provisioned
        FM->>FM: Initialize tenant-scoped<br/>schema / tables per module
        FM-->>Bus: Ready
    end

    Cfg->>Admin: Tenant provisioned<br/>(admin login URL, initial credentials)

    Note over Admin,FM: Hospital admin logs in → configures<br/>departments, wards, roles, IdP federation,<br/>reference data overrides
